cbsheet 1

# The bat (step 5, M282: every item a sheet): what it does to bodies (predicted: every simulation
# runs it) and how it looks. The damage and the heat are the melee mod's (melee.cpp), on melee.hit.

# Its names (the melee mod's C++ finds them) and its numbers.
# Its heat (M287): its own timer, set when it hits a player; shared, so it glows on others too.
field melee.hot_left timer on item shared
event melee.swing
event melee.strike
event melee.done
event melee.hit
param inventory.start 1
param pickup.hold_seconds 0.5 s

# A swing, on the left mouse button: the pack plays it (melee.swing), and at the clip's melee.strike
# marker a box where the player looks, pitch and all: 1.9 m ahead, 1.4 m across, 1.4 m from low to
# high, turned about the chest with the look. In it, the two nearest things, players first (M290: a
# player is never missed for a ball lying nearer): a player hurt by the server, nudged here, and the
# bat hot; a loose body knocked away. Without the marker (a body the pack does not fit) the timeout
# hits the same way. The next swing waits for melee.done, the follow-through's end: how long a swing
# lasts is the clip's alone (1.1 s, animation_packs/source/Sword_Attack.res).
let swing = box (1.4, 1.4, 1.9) at (0, 1, 1.05) turned look players first max 2

motion Swing on use
	cooldown 0.3
	emit melee.swing
	wait for melee.strike within 0.6
	find swing
		emit melee.hit
		if player
			change melee.hot_left = 2
			impulse 2 along facing
		else
			impulse 7 along facing
	timeout
	find swing
		emit melee.hit
		if player
			change melee.hot_left = 2
			impulse 2 along facing
		else
			impulse 7 along facing
	wait for melee.done within 1.3

# GlowWhileHot: for 2 s after it hurts someone (its timer).
react while melee.hot_left > 0
	set Model/Barrel surface_material_override/0:emission_energy_multiplier 4.0

# FlamesOnSwing
# SparksOnSwing: The sparks of a swing, started again at every swing. (A one-shot particle node that an animation only switches on does not start again while its last burst is still out: swings in a row had no sparks.)
react on melee.swing
	as holder
		play AnimationPlayer slash
		after 0.14
			call Model/Sparks restart

# SparksOnHit
react on melee.hit
	as holder
		call Model/Sparks restart
